{%- comment -%}
  School calendar section
  Place in /sections/school-calendar.liquid

  Uses the CPU CBA theme tokens and classes (section, page-width, section-head,
  eyebrow, lede, badge, chip, etc.).

  HOW TO EDIT EVENTS
  In the section settings, paste one event per line using this format:

    date | title | type

  - date  : YYYY-MM-DD for one day, or YYYY-MM-DD..YYYY-MM-DD for a range.
            Use commas for several ranges, e.g. 2027-02-04..2027-02-05, 2027-02-08..2027-02-09
  - title : the event name
  - type  : class, exam, holiday, deadline or event   (blank = event)

  Keep lines in date order. If a semester's box is left blank, the built-in
  AY 2026-2027 calendar below is shown.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign bg = section.settings.background
  assign section_class = 'section'
  if bg == 'cream'
    assign section_class = 'section section--cream'
  elsif bg == 'paper'
    assign section_class = 'section section--paper'
  elsif bg == 'navy'
    assign section_class = 'section section--navy on-dark'
  endif
  assign known_types = 'class,exam,holiday,deadline,event' | split: ','
  assign chip_labels = 'Classes,Exams,Holidays,Deadlines,Events' | split: ','
-%}

